{
  "title": "Swing-duration spectral flatness does not establish incremental Parkinson prediction: an exploratory cross-collection test",
  "abstract": "Swing-duration spectral flatness did not establish added Parkinson/control prediction beyond conventional gait summaries: target delta logloss 0.000337, source-plus-target bootstrap95%CI [-0.045666,0.074573]. This is exploratory cross-collection evidence, not independent-participant confirmation.",
